### Describe the bug

Passing plugins to `swc.transformFile` throws an error:

```
/path/node_modules/@swc/core/index.js:78
            const res = yield bindings.parseFile(path, toBuffer(options));
                                       ^

Error
    at Compiler.<anonymous> (/path/node_modules/@swc/core/index.js:78:40)
    at Generator.next (<anonymous>)
